<title>HONG KONG: Everbright-IHD soars on trade resumption.</title>
<headline>Everbright-IHD soars on trade resumption.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd soared when they resumed trading on Thursday, following the release of details of the company's planned near and longer term acquisitions.</p>
<p>Analysts said investors were eager to take a stake in what could become the first interest in a domestic mainland Chinese bank offered to overseas investors.</p>
<p>Everbright-IHD climbed to a high of HK$17.95, then eased to trade HK$5.45 up at HK$17.35 on heavy trade of HK$892 million.</p>
</text>
